   "versionNonce": 750473711,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Grey dashed arrows: assetHandlerAddress[assetId]\nset by steps 2 and 7 (a reference, not a call).",
   "originalText": "Grey dashed arrows: assetHandlerAddress[assetId]\nset by steps 2 and 7 (a reference, not a call).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el41",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1630,
   "y": 100,
   "width": 504.90000000000003,
   "height": 318.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 559236685,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 63254576,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "0. Deploy the ADT and the asset handler on L1,\n\u2003\u2003and the asset handler on L2\n1. setAssetDeploymentTracker on L1AssetRouter\n\u2003\u2003(owner whitelists the ADT for the asset data)\n2. setAssetHandlerAddressThisChain on L1AssetRouter,\n\u2003\u2003called by the ADT (assetId encodes the ADT)\n3. requestL2TransactionTwoBridges on L1Bridgehub;\n\u2003\u2003secondBridge = L1AssetRouter,\n\u2003\u2003data = 0x02 || (assetId, L2 asset handler)\n4. bridgehubDeposit on L1AssetRouter\n5. bridgeCheckCounterpartAddress on the ADT\n\u2003\u2003(validates caller and L2 asset handler)\n6. bridgehubRequestL2Transaction on the chain's Mailbox\n7. priority tx: setAssetHandlerAddress on L2AssetRouter\n\u2003\u2003(from aliased L1AssetRouter)",
   "originalText": "0. Deploy the ADT and the asset handler on L1,\n\u2003\u2003and the asset handler on L2\n1. setAssetDeploymentTracker on L1AssetRouter\n\u2003\u2003(owner whitelists the ADT for the asset data)\n2. setAssetHandlerAddressThisChain on L1AssetRouter,\n\u2003\u2003called by the ADT (assetId encodes the ADT)\n3. requestL2TransactionTwoBridges on L1Bridgehub;\n\u2003\u2003secondBridge = L1AssetRouter,\n\u2003\u2003data = 0x02 || (assetId, L2 asset handler)\n4. bridgehubDeposit on L1AssetRouter\n5. bridgeCheckCounterpartAddress on the ADT\n\u2003\u2003(validates caller and L2 asset handler)\n6. bridgehubRequestL2Transaction on the chain's Mailbox\n7. priority tx: setAssetHandlerAddress on L2AssetRouter\n\u2003\u2003(from aliased L1AssetRouter)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
